window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Never make a deal with a Fae. You’ll end up on your knees, begging for your life.</b></p> <p>Dark Falls—the most prestigious school in the three realms—is in session. Brooding vampires, snarky mermaids, and vicious Fae all want a piece of me...and they're not willing to ask permission.</p> <p>Flynn, the cruel bully.</p> <p>Trent, the thirsty vampire.</p> <p>And Cole, the dark Fae prince. I hate him most of all.</p> <p>How am I supposed to kick their asses in the arena and the classroom with all the mysteries and dangers lurking in the stony halls?</p> <p>I’m mortal. They will live forever.</p> <p>They want me out of the academy. They’re beautiful. Devious. Relentless.<br> <br> <b>I'm worse.<br> I'm a Winslow witch, and I've got enough fire to burn them all.</b></p> <p><b><i>Forbidden Magic</i></b><i> is an enemies-to-lovers academy romance with strong paranormal fantasy elements. Expect off-the-charts tension and a kick-ass heroine. Witches, pointy fangs, and a wicked prince, oh my! Pick up your copy now and fall under the spell of Dark Falls’ gorgeous beasts.</i></p>"; 
